solution.en:
(a) Line 12: `return NULL` after `malloc` failed. The file handle f is still open: leaked. Line 15: `return NULL` after `fgets` failed. Both the block buf and the file handle f are leaked. Line 25: `name` is overwritten with a new result while the first string is still in it. If the first call succeeded, that block can no longer be reached and is leaked. Line 28: if the second call succeeded, the second `free(name)` frees a block that is already freed: a double free, which is undefined behaviour (if `name` is NULL, `free` does nothing).

(b) Release on every path:

char *read_first_line(const char *path) {
    FILE *f = fopen(path, "r");
    if (f == NULL) {
        return NULL;
    }
    char *buf = malloc(64);
    if (buf == NULL) {
        fclose(f);
        return NULL;
    }
    if (fgets(buf, 64, f) == NULL) {
        free(buf);
        fclose(f);
        return NULL;
    }
    fclose(f);
    buf[strcspn(buf, "\n")] = '\0';
    return buf;
}

The idea: on each early return, release everything acquired so far, in the reverse order of acquiring. (A single exit label with goto is a good alternative for longer functions.)

(c) The function returns a heap string, so the caller owns it. The caller must free it exactly once, before the variable that holds it is reused, and should set the pointer to NULL after freeing (free(NULL) is harmless). In main: free the first name before the second assignment, and call free only once for the second.

solution.zh:
（a）第 12 行：`malloc` 失败之后 `return NULL`。文件句柄 f 仍然是打开的：泄漏。第 15 行：`fgets` 失败之后 `return NULL`。内存块 buf 和文件句柄 f 都泄漏了。第 25 行：`name` 里还保存着第一个字符串，就被新的结果覆盖了。如果第一次调用成功，那个内存块就再也找不到了，造成泄漏。第 28 行：如果第二次调用成功，第二个 `free(name)` 释放了已经释放的内存块：重复释放，是未定义行为（如果 `name` 是 NULL，`free` 什么都不做）。

（b）每条路径都要释放：

char *read_first_line(const char *path) {
    FILE *f = fopen(path, "r");
    if (f == NULL) {
        return NULL;
    }
    char *buf = malloc(64);
    if (buf == NULL) {
        fclose(f);
        return NULL;
    }
    if (fgets(buf, 64, f) == NULL) {
        free(buf);
        fclose(f);
        return NULL;
    }
    fclose(f);
    buf[strcspn(buf, "\n")] = '\0';
    return buf;
}

思路：每个提前返回的地方，都要按获取的相反顺序释放到目前为止获得的所有资源。（对较长的函数，用单一出口标签加 goto 也是很好的做法。）

（c）函数返回的是堆字符串，所以调用者拥有它。调用者必须恰好释放一次，并且要在保存它的变量被重新使用之前释放；释放之后最好把指针置为 NULL（free(NULL) 是无害的）。在 main 里：给 name 赋第二个值之前先释放第一个字符串，并且对第二个字符串只调用一次 free。

